{"title":"Radical Shack","slug":"Radical_Shack","pageid":864,"revid":18523,"timestamp":"2025-06-25T20:39:37Z","lastEditor":"SmithHenderson","categories":["Locations"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Michael Rad"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Buying surfboards, beachball, records and the Living Axe"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"???"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"???"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<p><br>\nThe <b>Radical Shack</b> is a shop in Oaklands. The shop sells Beach related items.\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The Radical Shack is found by taking a right turn before crossing the drawbridge, then taking a right turn at the first fork in the road, which will lead players to a beach on the other side of the map. The store is owned by <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Micheal_Rad/\">Micheal Rad</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"tools\">Tools</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Living_Axe/\">The Living Axe</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: LivingAxeBox no BG\">LivingAxeBox no BG</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$16,790\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Beachball/\">Beachball</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BeachBall Box\">BeachBall Box</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$490\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rice/\">Rice</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RiceBowl\">RiceBowl</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Surfboard/\">Surfboard</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: SurfBoardBox\">SurfBoardBox</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$784\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pillow/\">Pillow</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pillow no BG\">Pillow no BG</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$4,799\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Sun_Is_Rising/\">The Sun is rising</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The sun is rising Vinyl\">The sun is rising Vinyl</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Unity/\">Unity</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Unity Vinyl\">Unity Vinyl</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Rusty_Scooba_Tank/\">Rusty Scooba Tank</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rusty-Scooba-Tank\">Rusty-Scooba-Tank</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$10,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to the map revamp, a player could take the Pillow off of Michael Rad's bed to purchase it. It is now hidden behind the crates behind Michael Rad.</li></ul>"}
